OL,3,GNEWSADefibrillator hub plan refused as
OL,4,A'visual clutter'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to install a defibrillator,
OL,7,Fadvertising screen and a telephone in a
OL,8,Fcity centre have been refused over
OL,9,Fconcerns it would harm the character of
OL,10,Fthe area.
OL,12,FWakefield Council planners said the
OL,13,Fproposed communication unit would
OL,14,F"introduce visual clutter" within a
OL,15,Fconservation area and negatively impact
OL,16,Fnearby historic buildings.
OL,18,FA planning application by In Focus
OL,19,FPublic Networks sought permission to
OL,20,Finstall the 8.6 ft (2.63m) structure on
OL,21,Fthe pavement outside NatWest Bank on
OL,22,FWestgate.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
